<!--
  Alternate palette tonal ramps (design system v2 §6.2).

  Four optional palettes sit alongside the default Calm scheme. Each ramp was
  generated by solving for the CIE L* target of each Material tone step from
  the palette seed, so tone N has comparable perceived lightness across every
  palette and contrast ratios hold when the user switches. Saturation tapers
  above tone 80 so the light end reads as tinted paper rather than neon.

  Seeds:
    Forest  primary #2D6A4F  secondary #B5A642   deep green + olive
    Ocean   primary #1B7A8A  secondary #D4826A   teal + coral
    Dusk    primary #6B5B95  secondary #C4868A   violet + dusty rose
    Mono    primary #5A5652  secondary #8A8580   warm greys, near-achromatic

  Mono is deliberately a single ramp: its two seeds are both near-neutral, so
  primary and secondary are separated by tone rather than by hue.

  Generated, not hand-picked. Do not edit individual steps by hand; adjust the
  seed and regenerate so the ramp stays perceptually even.
-->
